WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.312 --> 00:00:03.571
(soft dramatic music)

00:00:03.571 --> 00:00:07.321
(speaks in foreign language)

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:32.764
(piano music)

00:00:32.764 --> 00:00:33.597
- [Narrator] The island of Budelli,

00:00:33.597 --> 00:00:35.010
part of the La Maddalena
International Park,

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.170
sits on the northern coast of Sardinia.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.280
It's considered to be one of

00:00:38.280 --> 00:00:41.440
the most beautiful islands
in the Mediterranean Sea.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:45.540
Only accessible by boat, Mauro
Morandi, the soul inhabitant

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:50.360
first arrived here 29 years
ago, and he never left.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:54.110
(speaks in foreign language)

00:01:12.521 --> 00:01:13.728
(upbeat music)

00:01:13.728 --> 00:01:17.478
(speaks in foreign language)

